(7,-10,6,'New sign in to your SCL Institute LMS (Development) account','Hi Mohammed Hassan,\n\nYour SCL Institute LMS (Development) account was just signed in to from a\nnew device.\n\n	* Your account: mohammed.hassan@example.com\n	* Wednesday, 11 February 2026, 2:42 PM\n	* Device: Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36\n(KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/144.0.0.0 Safari/537.36 Edg/144.0.0.0\n	* IP: 172.21.0.1\n\nIf this was you, then you don\'t need to do anything.\n\nIf you don\'t recognise this activity, please change your password [1].\n\n\nLinks:\n------\n[1] http://localhost:9090/login/change_password.php\n',1,'<p>Hi Mohammed Hassan,</p>\n<p>Your SCL Institute LMS (Development) account was just signed in to from a new device.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Your account: mohammed.hassan@example.com </li>\n<li>Wednesday, 11 February 2026, 2:42 PM</li>\n<li>Device:  Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/144.0.0.0 Safari/537.36 Edg/144.0.0.0</li>\n<li>IP: 172.21.0.1</li>\n</ul>\n<p>If this was you, then you don\'t need to do anything.</p>\n<p>If you don\'t recognise this activity, please <a href=\"http://localhost:9090/login/change_password.php\">change your password</a>.</p>','Your mohammed.hassan@example.com account was just signed in to from a new device.','moodle','newlogin',NULL,NULL,NULL,1770820978,'{\"notificationiconurl\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost:9090\\/theme\\/image.php\\/boost\\/core\\/1770576375\\/u\\/f1\",\"courseid\":\"1\"}'),
